@baseUrl = https://localhost:7001/api

### ── MOVIES ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

### 1. Create a Movie
POST {{baseUrl}}/movies
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Leo",
  "description": "Action thriller by Lokesh Kanagaraj",
  "durationMinutes": 164,
  "releaseDate": "2023-10-19",
  "language": "Tamil",
  "genre": "Action"
}

###

### 2. Get All Movies
GET {{baseUrl}}/movies?pageNumber=1&pageSize=10

###

### 3. Search Movies by Title
GET {{baseUrl}}/movies/search?title=Leo

###

### 4. Get Movie by ID
GET {{baseUrl}}/movies/1

###

### ── THEATRES ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

### 5. Create a Theatre
POST {{baseUrl}}/theatres
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "PVR Cinemas",
  "location": "Grand Mall, Chennai"
}

###

### 6. Get All Theatres
GET {{baseUrl}}/theatres

###

### ── SCREENS ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

### 7. Create a Screen
POST {{baseUrl}}/screens
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "theatreId": 1,
  "screenName": "Screen 1 - IMAX"
}

###

### 8. Get Screens by Theatre
GET {{baseUrl}}/screens/theatre/1

###

### ── SEATS ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

### 9. Bulk Create Seats for Screen (creates A1-A3 Premium, B1-B3 Regular)
POST {{baseUrl}}/seats/bulk
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "screenId": 1,
  "seats": [
    { "rowName": "A", "seatNumber": 1, "seatType": "Premium" },
    { "rowName": "A", "seatNumber": 2, "seatType": "Premium" },
    { "rowName": "A", "seatNumber": 3, "seatType": "Premium" },
    { "rowName": "B", "seatNumber": 1, "seatType": "Regular" },
    { "rowName": "B", "seatNumber": 2, "seatType": "Regular" },
    { "rowName": "B", "seatNumber": 3, "seatType": "Regular" }
  ]
}

###

### 10. Get Physical Seats for Screen
GET {{baseUrl}}/seats/screen/1

###

### ── SHOWS ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

### 11. Schedule a Show (auto-generates ShowSeats for all 6 physical seats)
POST {{baseUrl}}/shows
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "movieId": 1,
  "screenId": 1,
  "startTime": "2026-11-15T18:00:00",
  "endTime": "2026-11-15T20:44:00",
  "ticketPrice": 250.00
}

###

### 12. Get All Shows
GET {{baseUrl}}/shows

###

### 13. Get Show Seat Layout (all 6 seats = Available)
GET {{baseUrl}}/shows/1/seats

###

### 14. Get Only Available Seats
GET {{baseUrl}}/shows/1/seats/available

###

### ── BOOKINGS ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

### 15. Book Seats A1 and A2 (seatIds 1 and 2)
POST {{baseUrl}}/bookings
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "customerName": "Arun Kumar",
  "customerEmail": "arun@example.com",
  "customerPhone": "9876543210",
  "showId": 1,
  "seatIds": [1, 2]
}

###

### 16. Try to Book A1 Again → Expect 409 Conflict
POST {{baseUrl}}/bookings
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "customerName": "Kavitha",
  "customerEmail": "kavitha@example.com",
  "customerPhone": "9123456780",
  "showId": 1,
  "seatIds": [1, 3]
}

###

### 17. Get Booking by ID
GET {{baseUrl}}/bookings/1

###

### 18. Check Seat Layout (A1, A2 = Booked; rest = Available)
GET {{baseUrl}}/shows/1/seats

###

### 19. Cancel Booking
PUT {{baseUrl}}/bookings/1/cancel

###

### 20. Verify Seats Released (all 6 back to Available)
GET {{baseUrl}}/shows/1/seats

###
